#. Right-click "happy"/"heureuse" on either side for synonyms.
msgid "She seemed very happy today."
msgstr "Elle semblait très heureuse aujourd'hui."

#. Right-click "beautiful"/"beau" on either side for synonyms.
msgid "It was a beautiful sunset."
msgstr "C'était un beau coucher de soleil."

#. Right-click "quick"/"rapide" on either side for synonyms.
msgid "He gave a quick reply."
msgstr "Il a donné une réponse rapide."

#. Right-click "small"/"petite" on either side for synonyms.
msgid "It was a small mistake."
msgstr "C'était une petite erreur."
